{"title":"Kobold Trapper","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 15 Kobold that attacks with stab (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (2.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>34</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=14\" title=\"Pick level 14\"><td><b>14</b></td><td>43</td><td>12.2</td><td>700</td><td class=\"muted\">129 · 17.1 · 2,100</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=15\" title=\"Pick level 15\"><td><b>15</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>46</td><td>12.8</td><td>750</td><td class=\"muted\">138 · 17.9 · 2,250</td><td>9</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>16</b></td><td>50</td><td>13.3</td><td>800</td><td class=\"muted\">150 · 18.6 · 2,400</td><td>36</td><td>in the wilds around -626, -461</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>34</td><td>in the wilds around -614, -463</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/kobold-trapper?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"kobold-trapper\" data-map-level=\"16\">Show level 16 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 11 recorded drops, 249 total, 9–35 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×9–35</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 8 of 9 looted corpses, 8 recorded drops, 50 total, 1–9 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 2 of 9 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 14 total, 6–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×6–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"coldwater-fishing-line\" title=\"Coldwater Fishing Line - in 2 of 9 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d139a643070917d1c9b5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Coldwater Fishing Line</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+7 more\">+7 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"kobold-scale\" title=\"Kobold Scale - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ed5b9bf7451b5863f7f1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kobold Scale</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"hollowmark-survey-ledger\" title=\"Hollowmark Survey Ledger - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8f3d6f05c2035375beec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hollowmark Survey Ledger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sledge-supply-bundle\" title=\"Sledge Supply Bundle - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1d28a39ad570045c5db2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sledge Supply Bundle</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\